coi ro do

I would like to issue a survey about how to Lojbanize foreign names=20
containing a semivowel directly preceded by a consonant sound. Since the=20
end of 2014, after a vote of the BPFK, any sequence of a consonant=20
directly followed by a semivowel (for example "ia" in "kenias") is=20
banned from Lojban words (cmavo, brivla and cmevla included). However=20
the BPFK did not give any recommendation on what alternative=20
Lojbanization to favor. I have thus made this little survey to gather=20
the opinions of Lojbanists on which Lojbanization they prefer with=20
regard to semivowels.

Here is the link to the survey:

=E2=80=A2=20
https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScW66FzOnPcCDxn-v0gcd7IzXXrS8vPEG1=
GoubIom1XQyfb8g/viewform

I'm looking forward to reading your opinions.

=E2=80=94Ilmen.


